   "announcedAt": "2024-02-01T17:00:58.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Bonjour Detectives,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're thrilled to bring you the latest patch for Murder on the Orient Express, packed with fixes and improvements to enhance your gaming experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "General Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Resolved a rare issue where the first Steam achievement might not complete. Your detective skills deserve recognition!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Enhanced French localization for an improved immersive experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Options Menu Enhancements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "When starting a New Game without any existing save data, the in-game voice language will automatically synchronize with the selected text language.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated camera settings in the main menu for a more refined experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "When players deactivate subtitles in the Options menu, they are automatically reactivated each time the game is launched.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Chapter-Specific Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In Chapter 1, fixed a scenario where the cutscene would go away if the interaction key was spammed after inspecting Freja's dessert.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter 3: Ensured that quitting the game after speaking with Ms. Moreau won't prevent unlocking a mind map node.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter 7: Corrected the order of photos of ransom money when inspecting them, and fixed a text issue when inspecting Mr. MacQueen's photo.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter 13: Rectified a linguistic hiccup, replacing \"St Pancreas\" with the correct \"St Pancras\" during Mr. MacQueen's dialogue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your continued support, detectives! Dive back into the mystery with these improvements, and keep those gray cells active. Happy investigating! 🕵️‍♂️🔍",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "🚂 Play Agatha Christie - Murder on the Orient Express now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "📬 Stay connected!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Microids Lyon Twitter - Twitter - Facebook - Instagram - TikTok - Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
